# ATI.SU — Logistics Platform for Road Freight Market

ATI.SU is a digital B2B logistics platform for road freight transportation.
It provides tools for freight exchange, truck search, freight tenders,
market analytics, route distance calculation, counterparty verification,
electronic document workflow (EDI), and logistics automation.

The platform is designed for shippers, carriers, freight forwarders,
logistics companies and supply chain managers operating in Russia,
CIS countries and international corridors.

